   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "Identical composition to the r-RSM gel medium minus chymosin (this is the uncoagulated liquid RSM). Paper defines only 10% reconstituted low-heat skim milk (Valio) + 10 mM CaCl2, 90 C/30 min; milk composition is not tabulated, so lactose/mineral/trace/vitamin values are native skim-milk values from MilkFacts.info (skim milk per 100g ~= 10% reconstituted milk). Added vs previous curation: calcium, inorganic phosphate, niacin, and trace metals Cu/Fe/Mn/Se. Confidence medium (composition from generic dairy references, not the paper)."
  },
